# Complete lower-6401 research tree (lossless archive)

This comment contains a standard-base64 gzip tar archive of the complete
`ProximityPrize/SubmissionLower` research tree at the reference checkpoint.
It is intentionally not imported by `Solution.lean`.

To reconstruct, copy the lines between the markers to `archive.b64`, then run:

    base64 -D -i archive.b64 -o lower6401-reference.tar.gz   # macOS
    base64 -d archive.b64 > lower6401-reference.tar.gz      # GNU/Linux
    tar -xzf lower6401-reference.tar.gz

